                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This module is based on the data included in the report Oekoinventare von Energiesystemen 1996. The diesel consumption and the emissions are updated using the Swiss "Offroad database" and applied to year 2000. The particle emissions are roughly estimated based on the BUWAL report "Partikelfilter für schwere Nutzfahrzeuge, 2000". This module should not be used if its relative importance would be high in a certain environmental inventory.;
