        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average current technology for one typical machine representing the category.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the inputs "building machine" for infrastructure, lubricating oil and fuel consumption, and some measured air emissions as output, based on the ecoinvent database v2.2. Additionally reduced particle emissions due to particle filters are considered. Reduction factor: 97.4%</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
